NAME
     blockdev - ask a block device about itself

SYNOPSIS
     blockdev --getsize64|--getsz|--getss|--getbsz|--getro|--setro|--setrw|--rereadpt DEVICE

DESCRIPTION
     blockdev asks the kernel about a block device: its size in bytes or
     in sectors, its sector size, its block size, whether it is
     read-only -- and sets those last two.

SEE ALSO
     blkid(8), losetup(8), sfdisk(8)
